      "message": "[warning] Line 49: 🟡 `openEmojiPicker()` should reset `hiding` before reopening. If the picker is reopened before a pending `emojiPickerHideFinished()` callback from the previous close arrives, `hiding` is still `true`, and that stale callback can execute `root.visible \u003d false` and immediately hide the newly reopened popup. Set `hiding \u003d false` at the start of `openEmojiPicker()` (or guard callbacks with a close-generation token).",
